---
import PageShell from "@layouts/PageShell.astro";
import PageHeader from "@components/ui/PageHeader.astro";
import { site, whatsappUrl, localizedPath } from "@config/site";

const locale = "en" as const;
const c = site.brand;
const wa = whatsappUrl();
const restriccionesHref = localizedPath("/politicas-y-restricciones", locale);
---

<PageShell
  title="Cancellation policy"
  description="What happens if the weather prevents flying, how to change your date, refunds, and what happens if you arrive late."
  logicalPath="/politica-de-cancelacion"
  activeId=""
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Cancellation policy"
    lead="If the weather prevents flying, your flight is rescheduled to the date you choose and you have 3 months to use it. Changes are made 48 hours in advance."
  />

  <article class="legal container-narrow">
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: July 22, 2026</p>

    <h2>If the weather prevents flying</h2>
    <p>
      The flight depends on wind and visibility. With rain or wind over 20 km/h, for your safety
      the flight is cancelled. The captain makes the call, always in favor of safety: if in doubt,
      we do not fly.
    </p>
    <p>
      In that case your flight is rescheduled to the date you choose, and you have 3 months to
      take it.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you booked ground transport and the flight is cancelled due to bad weather, the transport
      service is covered 100 %: the van did run.
    </p>

    <h2>If you want to change your date</h2>
    <p>
      You have 48 hours before the flight to make changes. After that window, a 30 % penalty
      applies. Message us on
      <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or at
      <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a> with your booking number.
    </p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>
      Deposits are non-refundable. The only exception is foreign passengers, with a passport or
      visa and/or a verifiable itinerary.
    </p>

    <h2>If you do not arrive</h2>
    <p>
      The balloon takes off at sunrise and cannot wait. Arrive at the time on your boarding pass:
      that is the check-in time, before takeoff. Tolerance is 10 minutes, and the absolute maximum
      is 15. After that the flight is shorter, and on a shared flight the balloon takes off without
      you, with no right to rescheduling or refund.
    </p>
    <p>Not showing up incurs a charge of 100 % of the deposit and/or the flight.</p>

    <h2>Restrictions that prevent flying</h2>
    <p>
      The following cannot fly: pregnant women, anyone who has consumed alcohol in the previous 12
      hours, and people with blood pressure issues, cardio-respiratory conditions, recent
      surgeries, or spine and/or knee problems. The maximum weight per passenger is 99 kilos.
    </p>
    <p>
      These are not recommendations: the pilot may deny boarding at the field. The full list is in
      <a href={restriccionesHref}>flight policies and restrictions</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="legal-contact">
      Questions about this document? Message us on
      <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or at
      <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</PageShell>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-block: var(--space-md) var(--space-3xl);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .legal-contact {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
